                             Points**\n    71\t*   **Power & Reference:**\n    72\t    *   TP1 (TSREF), TP2 (LDOIN), TP3 (NEG5V), TP4 (NPNB)\n    73\t    *   TP5                
                             (CVDD), TP6 (AVDD), TP7 (REFHP), TP8 (BAT), TP9 (DVDD)\n    74\t*   **Ground:** TP13, TP14, TP15\n    75\t*   **Communication &                     
                             Logic:** TP12 (RX), TP42 (TX), TP43 (NFAULT)\n    76\t*   **Auxiliary Sense:** TP10 (BBP), TP11 (BBN)\n    77\t\n    78\t**Temperature              
                             Sensing Components**\n    79\t*   **Pullup Resistors (10.0k):** R7, R8, R11, R14, R15, R16, R18, R19.\n    80\t*   **Thermistors                    
