                             pinout text vs schematic wires. Text says Pin 5 is TX, Pin 4 is RX. Schematic wires show Pin 4 is TX, Pin 3 is RX_C. Schematic wires                
                             are assumed correct.\n   176\t\n   177\t# VHL Component Library References\n   178\t\n   179\t| Designator | Component Name |\n                     
